                "text": "I am proud to stand with the @DemWomenCaucus and @RepSusanWild to demand passage of critical legislation to protect IVF. Decisions about IVF should be between patients and their doctors \u2013 and not judges and politicians. That is why we are demanding that the House pass the Access to Family Building Act NOW!",
