                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Recently, I had the opportunity to meet with representatives from the American College of Emergency Physicians. We engaged in a substantive discussion about the critical issues that are presently impacting the dedicated professionals that provide care to patients in emergency rooms across the country.\n\nFrom the significant increase in acts of violence being perpetrated against health care workers, to the proper and timely reimbursement for services, to the growing demand for providing long-term care, the issues emergency physicians face are complex. That is why I am so pleased to have heard directly from these professionals who are committed to improving the emergency care and our nation\u2019s health care safety net.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
