                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Health care decisions should be made between patients and providers, NOT judges and politicians.\n\nToday, #SCOTUS is hearing a case that threatens Americans\u2019 right to emergency abortion care when their lives hang in the balance. As a member of @ProChoiceCaucus, I have joined my colleagues in urging the justices to do the right thing and protect patients\u2019 rights and protect reproductive freedom.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": [
                    "ProChoiceCaucus"
