                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Yesterday, House Republicans voted to criminalize health care providers for offering life-saving care and to take critical medical decisions out of the hands of doctors and patients.\n\nH.R. 21 is a blatant attack on reproductive rights and significantly restricts the care for women facing heartbreaking, life-threatening pregnancies. Doctors should be focused on providing compassionate care, not worrying about being prosecuted for doing their jobs.\n\nI\u2019m proud to stand with my @DemWomenCaucus and @ReproCaucus colleagues and vote against this dangerous bill. Together, we\u2019re working to ensure that everyone can make the best health care decisions for their bodies, their lives, and their futures \u2013 especially when it matters most.",
